# dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored. The bundle is committed because harnesses
# launch `node dist/index.js` directly, with no install or build step. That
# coupling is exactly what let src and dist drift apart for weeks (gc_records
# was in src and missing from dist from f55c692 until agents@6b0641d), so if
# packaging ever moves to npm, ignore dist/ and publish the artifact instead.
# Tracked in GC-3719.
